{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/56luhuaw3CyptVs70JAAIA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:14.017269+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/56luhuaw3CyptVs70JAAIA","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsNQKnpXREH3vKe1iazHBwP0DQWL4sqFsYN2pLX0frTuWnxHZzmIqyQ616XfFbZQRIrT6gZruGic7EhW2L7TcVOUhKhCT1J8gJ4gU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsOCZXywDyrNd9j9zkia1CJBKHib2cq7NmUWYdlQ2SkhWh38mWiciabURocXYNNqCn51VDr31NuhjsMDic7KtSOJlKntQEhIAjE1lDeo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>关于举办</span></span></strong></span><span><strong><span><span>山东农业大学</span></span><span><span><span>林学院</span></span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>2026年</span></span></strong></span><strong><span><span><span>“优秀大学生暑期夏令营</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><font><span><span>的通知</span></span></font></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsMBD7AtLKHDnTOMFD7WITlQRibQr3VHufI3wycpLnmMqAqic0KHLcFJechbLRGrYf4pHLictBMQkon6SibgscTebv1xyHnU0l8U9ho/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>夏令营活动是优秀本科生对学院零距离、全方位了解的重要渠道和平台，为促进优秀本科生之间的交流，吸引优秀青年学子走进山农，了解山农林学院各学科和实验室，增强科研兴趣、拓宽学术视野，感受导师风采，体验农大魅力。经研究决定，山东农业大学林学院2026年将举办“优秀大学生暑期夏令营”活动，诚意邀请全国各高校相关专业优秀本科生参加。现将夏令营有关事项通知如下：</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsO4VZJ0PDlEBJODklGPScVwKkLLwuT9licEmJrwZJ1PQIcBouNHGf1L3f6c9gsFRXGLw39EckpD0gDhNWrcGElBtPcufS7mrrcs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsNeuXXO8jbsFqY3NDsCUlqu9sWebHYWQPbGvqPTDmVQlI3EDm1pibSicP4Sw2WCVdZaAurY14ELndetMia6xohjW5ibLRagPtnicribE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>一、时间地点</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsNsuc7rAoApa1icDXj8sWWajY4CmZFIIEv3Xg0qhcR7Bw6PdM5FqKiaB7ppWu5JhOr3xNUPMOCUkcQxag4gTPg8ssrWpd8vq7sNM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 时间</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>2026年7月11日—7月12日</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsMgxnCKovdJzqoeR4C4P3UWCHb2vZYMicEdGMhTYOxjEFibsUEsiaPpmfQ0CAa9TEAgNeNibW4StOvrvsOq4wKvayBjiaxKx4KNZUHI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2. 活动内容</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>林学院2026年大学生夏令营活动内容包括： 开营式、专业方向导师见面会、课题组交流互动等。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><section><p><span>7月11日</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>下午：报到</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>7月12日</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>上午：夏令营开营式、学院整体情况介绍、营员自我介绍和学习规划、专业方向导师/课题组见面交流会</span></p><p><span>下午：参观科研实验室、闭营离校</span></p></section></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsNs4liczuRV8SN67V9kIeibWX7ibXMByuhq8oLKAjLKyOkrgsfjRZrcto3gwfQNTRfysob9EIbGXeibibBxJFnxldrJh8DHwnDeibQ2g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsPcibFyh80yzkicRJlRd1cd8iaRmDS6zP4cicms7vEkFgvEbJXKjcaYgY0GZuLfDOa5SfXz2AibaEj2BCz7QmKVAOggVQXhldZESfP0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>二、申请条件</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1. 坚持四项基本原则，品德优良，遵纪守法，具有创新意识和团队精神，在校期间未受过任何法纪处分，身心健康；</span></p><p><span>2. 学习成绩优秀，综合排名前50%，英语水平良好；</span></p><p><span>3. 报考的硕士专业须与本科专业相关或相近（参见《山东农业大学2026年硕士研究生招生专业目录》；</span></p><p><span>4. 有志于从事科学研究工作，品德良好，有较强的表达和沟通能力。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsPGlJuWNt6MExzVV22wuZPiaqNApa6x5JeobOC8faYhI4OCMlKjtC3IEicmH137HtGn4Eic5u2oe03ySbAGnYzzawJeTlKFVls2Zg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsMSRVl16UlYwibFDspla32DYUec0nAQVdlfz3ejcSh4erRVXicuGrtwtU61TYuCYINOfPsibVXlVQObvXBnLpp0F6dFJoRR61ga6Y/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>三、申请材料</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1. 山东农业大学林学院2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表（附件1，</span><span>由林学院官网下载</span><span>）1份，应如实填写各项信息并由院校相关部门签字盖章；</span></p><p><span>2. 本科在读期间成绩单（含学习成绩排名，需学校教务部门签字盖章）1份；</span></p><p><span>3. 英语CET-4/6成绩单（复印件）；</span></p><p><span>4. 其他证明材料（已发表论文的首页、其他各类等级证书、奖状等复印件）；</span></p><p><span>5. 学生证（在读学期需注册完整）；</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsOo1KJPPHx7DIoU4Oup1RAxIPYkflDuAeJgibK6YgNyBUq9VvIdCYqcDUOiaLVnhIhzItaA8Uibs0KjFQNohLMJkNu5s5cckuOujw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>四、申请程序</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1. 报名</span></p><p><span><span>需将上述材料按照顺序扫描至一个PDF文件中，并以“夏令营报名林学院+本科所在学校+本科所学专业+姓名”命名发送至2170526851@qq.com。本校2027届本科生可直接到山东农业大学（岱宗校区）林学院（稷晖楼）113室报名。材料提交的截至时间为2026年7月5日。</span></span></p><p><span>2. 审核入围</span></p><p><span><span>申请材料的审核及营员的入选工作由山东农业大学林学院审核人负责。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsOaIqe0QzGsjMKldv1uT8YzB5MvCFWgQtcpGy7D10yJDfTuKibUohkNAbRYpHL8OxV9Nl703YZQpXibz003xrycaHtOqYngNVslc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>五、营员评选及相关事项</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>学院将根据申请材料、专家组考核结果及入营表现进行综合考核，评价等级为优秀、合格等等次。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsNYXyGx3QysxOt9zRup40Em8LESvtcsNkZIenMISS35F1FuWmxdQ8MGATNjdR4c2cIic8mJp3wyMq3ibq2VLK1T0vYh6SCENjqicw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>六、服务保障</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1.学院将为全程参加夏令营并且考核合格的营员发放城际交通补贴（需提供活动举办期间往返泰安的实名的交通凭证：火车票、汽车票等）；</span></p><p><span>2.学院将为营员统一发放餐券；</span></p><p><span>3.学院将为营员提供统一住宿（驻泰高校学生除外）。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsP0cqXIoOuMyL2jQrtsOUkhXkdiaAhNKZSQazJxhnljS9srTER7ODEeckh19Vc5X4HWswSkTHn7x9DFUff9twJuZ3npZ7d9nDZc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>七、有关事项</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1.申请者的申请材料务必真实，如有不实，将取消其营员资格，复试结果作废；</span></p><p><span>2.营员必须遵守我校相关规定，在参加夏令营活动中服从统一安排，保障自身安全；</span></p><p><span>3.营员报到后须全程参加夏令营活动，擅自离营者，学院将不提供相关资助；</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsPnkHvAOUa0ooFmicprMibpGCGjaXrHKVJLcHxOXMXR7Bk6mBsPJycfo9D5femicicXAzfUOsP8mzMHX0McJCNqcfKPvsqDaG70ee0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>八、联系方式</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>山东农业大学林学院研究生工作办公室</span></p><p><span>联系人：王旭、张佳辰</span></p><p><span>联系电话：0538-8249164</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Jd7NhVDJEsMVMd8sJFMktTv0p5tT6Qt9marxfS3fOyL7csvelrTX6VYucjIXzOJNCNGywicrg4MWReWRYofYsKHvN4RDHIbEbf9gW4XrvjIk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Jd7NhVDJEsPgwj7AvVPnFHvicdF2Vu1qFPvVlgEvUYCBJTQhcSic9Kga2iap8s3SR1ZogZCMlQuKJiad3iaJZ8IW00so8BQCQvZVu7pJsbSN4sj8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><sect